\meta{release}{Unreleased}
\meta{commit}{ecdc172}
\import{base-macros}

\p{The review of session memory found a hazard by reading the code (F-V1-M2): the machine wrote a pair entry and then grew the pair log, so that a growth refused for lack of heap left a pair entry that no reset clears. The log now grows first. There is no unit test for it: the case needs a log of 32 MiB and a full heap. Published with the fast tests green, 415 tests, together with a corrected class comment about the provider's priority.}

\p{Detail: \src{docs/research/profiles/V1.md}. Commit \commit{ecdc172}. Session: [profiles and prototypes](ses-JRSD).}
